25	// reported bug: a legal, sub-16-MiB request that saves to over 64 MiB is a
26	// 400 (send less content), not a 503 (storage failed, restart). The rejected
27	// batch leaves no durable record, the server keeps accepting batches with no
28	// restart, and the rejected id is free on the same process and after a
29	// kill/recovery cycle.
30	func TestServeOversizeBatchIs400AndStaysUsable(t *testing.T) {
